WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:08.344 --> 00:00:09.212
♪

00:00:08.678 --> 00:00:09.846
&gt;&gt; Tucker: UNIVERSITIES ARE

00:00:09.345 --> 00:00:10.613
OBSESSED, THEY SAY WITH

00:00:09.979 --> 00:00:11.681
STAMPING OUT HARASSMENT.

00:00:10.747 --> 00:00:13.650
THEY HAVE WHOLE PROGRAMS

00:00:11.814 --> 00:00:14.651
DEDICATED TO THAT.

00:00:13.783 --> 00:00:17.587
NOT ALL HARASSMENT.

00:00:14.784 --> 00:00:19.355
SOME IS FINE IT TURNS OUT.

