00:00:24.627 --> 00:00:26.562
THEY ARE NOT GOING TO DO

00:00:25.762 --> 00:00:28.464
ANYTHING ABOUT IT PROBABLY

00:00:26.696 --> 00:00:28.765
BECAUSE THEY DON'T LIKE HIS

00:00:28.598 --> 00:00:30.099
VIEWS.

00:00:28.898 --> 00:00:30.700
RYAN WOLF JOINS US TONIGHT.

00:00:30.233 --> 00:00:32.702
RYAN, WHAT HAPPENED?

00:00:30.833 --> 00:00:33.770
&gt;&gt; THANKS FOR HAVING ME ON,

00:00:32.835 --> 00:00:34.370
TUCKER.

00:00:33.970 --> 00:00:36.472
&gt;&gt; Tucker: THANKS.

00:00:34.570 --> 00:00:38.508
&gt;&gt; BACK BEFORE THE 2016

00:00:36.606 --> 00:00:41.577
ELECTION WE HAD A PANEL TALK

00:00:38.641 --> 00:00:46.149
THAT WAS HOSTED BY THE

00:00:41.711 --> 00:00:47.183
COLLEGE REPUBLICAN VOTE AND

00:00:46.282 --> 00:00:48.217
PUBLICATION ON OUR CAMPUS

00:00:47.317 --> 00:00:49.285
BEFORE DURING AND AFTER THIS

00:00:48.351 --> 00:00:50.820
EVENT THERE WERE MESSAGES

00:00:49.419 --> 00:00:52.989
ABOUT ME ON SOCIAL MEDIA AND

00:00:50.954 --> 00:00:56.125
IN GROUP CHATS AND THAT WERE

00:00:53.122 --> 00:00:57.193
KIND OF TRYING TO INTIMIDATE

00:00:56.259 --> 00:00:59.062
ME AND THEN AFTER THE EVENT

00:00:57.327 --> 00:01:00.763
I WAS HANDED A BOX OF

00:00:59.195 --> 00:01:02.598
SALTINE CRACKERS AND IN A

00:01:00.897 --> 00:01:04.600
GROUP CHAT DURING THE EVENT

00:01:02.732 --> 00:01:05.835
A STUDENT PHOTO SHOPPED MY

00:01:04.734 --> 00:01:07.937
FACE ONTO THE CRACKER.

00:01:05.969 --> 00:01:11.507
OUR SCHOOL HAS FAIRLY STRICT

00:01:08.071 --> 00:01:13.142
VERBAL ABUSE, HARASSMENT.

00:01:11.708 --> 00:01:15.445
&gt;&gt; Tucker: BY THE WAY, JUST

00:01:13.276 --> 00:01:18.147
TO CLARIFY I ASSUME THAT'S A

00:01:15.578 --> 00:01:18.514
SLUR AGAINST YOUR ETHNICITY,

00:01:18.281 --> 00:01:18.915
CORRECT.

00:01:18.715 --> 00:01:20.116
&gt;&gt; YES.

00:01:19.048 --> 00:01:20.516
THAT'S HOW IT WAS INTENDED.

00:01:20.249 --> 00:01:21.818
ABSOLUTELY.

00:01:20.650 --> 00:01:22.752
WE HAVE PRETTY STRICT RULES

00:01:21.951 --> 00:01:24.320
ABOUT HARASSMENT AT OUR

00:01:22.885 --> 00:01:25.588
SCHOOL WHICH, YOU KNOW,

00:01:24.454 --> 00:01:28.458
CLEARLY DON'T ABIDE BY THE

00:01:25.722 --> 00:01:29.492
FIRST AMENDMENT.

00:01:28.591 --> 00:01:30.660
BUT, WE ARE TRYING TO HOLD

00:01:29.625 --> 00:01:31.027
ALL STUDENTS TO THE SAME

00:01:30.793 --> 00:01:33.162
STANDARD.

00:01:31.160 --> 00:01:34.998
I REPORTED THE CONDUCT.

00:01:33.296 --> 00:01:36.833
ACTUALLY AT THE BEHEST OF

00:01:35.131 --> 00:01:40.370
ONE OF MY PROFESSORS WHO

00:01:36.966 --> 00:01:41.304
USED TO BE AN MSNBC HOST.

00:01:40.503 --> 00:01:43.406
MELISSA HARRIS PERRY.

00:01:41.437 --> 00:01:45.141
AND SO I SENT IN THESE

00:01:43.539 --> 00:01:47.577
REPORTS.

00:01:45.274 --> 00:01:49.245
AND THE UNIVERSITY BASICALLY

00:01:47.710 --> 00:01:53.816
AFTER SEVERAL LEAKS GAVE ME

00:01:49.379 --> 00:01:54.717
THESE OPTIONS I ASKED DO

00:01:53.950 --> 00:01:56.352
PRESS CHARGES.

00:01:54.851 --> 00:01:57.754
OPEN A SCHOOL JUDICIAL CASE

00:01:56.486 --> 00:01:59.889
AGAINST THE STUDENTS WHO

00:01:57.887 --> 00:02:00.923
HANDED ME A BOX OF CRACKERS

00:02:00.023 --> 00:02:05.361
AND PHOTO SHOPPED MY FACE

00:02:01.057 --> 00:02:08.031
ONTO THE BOX OF CRACKERS.

00:02:05.495 --> 00:02:09.699
-- FRANK PERSON THAT

00:02:08.164 --> 00:02:11.034
PRESIDENT TRUMP'S ELECTION

00:02:09.832 --> 00:02:11.934
SOMEHOW JUSTIFIED THEIR

00:02:11.167 --> 00:02:12.835
BEHAVIOR EVEN THOUGH THE

00:02:12.068 --> 00:02:14.537
INCIDENT HAPPENED BEFORE

00:02:12.969 --> 00:02:15.905
ELECTION DAY.

00:02:14.670 --> 00:02:17.040
AND THAT IF I BROUGHT A

00:02:16.039 --> 00:02:17.807
JUDICIAL CASE IT WOULD MAKE

00:02:17.173 --> 00:02:19.409
THINGS WORSE FOR ME.

00:02:17.940 --> 00:02:21.444
WE WERE HEADING INTO FINALS

00:02:19.542 --> 00:02:22.612
WEEK AND AT THE END OF THE

00:02:21.577 --> 00:02:24.847
SEMESTER I WANTED THIS TO BE

00:02:22.745 --> 00:02:26.249
OVER SO HE WOULD SAY --

00:02:25.048 --> 00:02:27.450
&gt;&gt; Tucker: DEAN GOLDSTEIN

00:02:26.382 --> 00:02:28.851
SAID, I WANT TO MAKE SURE

00:02:27.583 --> 00:02:29.719
I'M NOT MISCHARACTERIZING

00:02:28.985 --> 00:02:30.953
THIS THE PRESIDENT'S

00:02:29.852 --> 00:02:35.792
ELECTION SOMEHOW JUSTIFIED

00:02:31.087 --> 00:02:36.592
THIS ATTACK ON YOU?

00:02:35.992 --> 00:02:37.827
&gt;&gt; YEAH, HE DOESN'T SAY

00:02:36.726 --> 00:02:38.194
THINGS IN SHORT SENTENCES

00:02:37.960 --> 00:02:39.095
LIKE THAT.

00:02:38.327 --> 00:02:39.829
WHAT I TOOK AWAY FROM THAT

00:02:39.228 --> 00:02:41.931
PART OF THE CONVERSATION WAS

00:02:39.962 --> 00:02:42.732
THAT HE WAS TRYING TO

00:02:42.065 --> 00:02:44.000
JUSTIFY THEIR BEHAVIOR

00:02:42.865 --> 00:02:44.734
BECAUSE IT WAS A RESPONSE TO

00:02:44.133 --> 00:02:45.868
THE ELECTION OF PRESIDENT

00:02:44.867 --> 00:02:48.438
TRUMP.

00:02:46.069 --> 00:02:49.605
&gt;&gt; Tucker: I MEAN, THAT'S --

00:02:48.571 --> 00:02:49.872
I DON'T EVEN KNOW WHAT TO

00:02:49.739 --> 00:02:51.374
SAY.

00:02:50.073 --> 00:02:51.674
&gt;&gt; IT DOESN'T MAKE ANY

00:02:51.507 --> 00:02:52.408
SENSE.

00:02:51.874 --> 00:02:56.779
&gt;&gt; Tucker: NO, IT DOESN'T.

00:02:52.542 --> 00:02:58.181
AND I ASSUME THAT -- IF YOU

00:02:56.913 --> 00:02:59.515
HAD BEEN A DIFFERENT KIND OF

00:02:58.314 --> 00:03:01.050
PERSON, THIS WOULD HAVE BEEN

00:02:59.649 --> 00:03:01.350
SWIFTLY PUNISHED, I ASSUME,

00:03:01.184 --> 00:03:02.185
RIGHT?

00:03:01.484 --> 00:03:03.519
&gt;&gt; RIGHT, EXACTLY.

00:03:02.318 --> 00:03:04.754
WE HAD A RACIAL SLUR

00:03:03.653 --> 00:03:06.055
INCIDENT JUST A FEW WEEKS

00:03:04.887 --> 00:03:08.424
AGO AND LET ME BE CLEAR.

00:03:06.189 --> 00:03:09.625
I'M NOT EQUATING WHAT WAS

00:03:08.558 --> 00:03:09.959
SAID BY THIS GIRL SAID ABOUT

00:03:09.759 --> 00:03:12.295
ME.

00:03:10.093 --> 00:03:14.497
BUT THAT STUDENT WAS ASKED

00:03:12.428 --> 00:03:15.798
TO LEAVE OUR SCHOOL ABOUT

00:03:14.630 --> 00:03:16.966
TWO DAYS LATER.

00:03:15.932 --> 00:03:18.701
THIS TOOK SEVERAL WEEKS AND

00:03:17.100 --> 00:03:20.103
THEY WOULDN'T IVAN OPEN A

00:03:18.835 --> 00:03:20.536
JUDICIAL CASE ABOUT

00:03:20.236 --> 00:03:21.571
HARASSMENT.

00:03:20.670 --> 00:03:25.007
EVEN JUST KIND OF LEAVING

00:03:21.704 --> 00:03:25.708
THE RACE PART OUT OF IT.

00:03:25.208 --> 00:03:26.609
&gt;&gt; Tucker: DEAN GOLDSTEIN

00:03:25.842 --> 00:03:27.577
DIDN'T SAY IN THAT CASE

00:03:26.742 --> 00:03:29.212
BARACK OBAMA WAS ELECTED

00:03:27.710 --> 00:03:29.879
PRESIDENT NINE YEARS AGO.

00:03:29.345 --> 00:03:30.980
UNDERSTANDABLE THAT PEOPLE

00:03:30.012 --> 00:03:32.048
MIGHT DO THAT.

00:03:31.114 --> 00:03:33.916
THAT WASN'T THE EXCUSE HE

00:03:32.181 --> 00:03:34.217
GAVE IN THAT CASE I ASSUME,

00:03:34.050 --> 00:03:35.818
RIGHT?

00:03:34.350 --> 00:03:36.119
&gt;&gt; OH, NO.

00:03:35.952 --> 00:03:37.086
YEAH.

00:03:36.252 --> 00:03:38.688
THIS INCIDENT JUST HAPPENED

00:03:37.220 --> 00:03:39.489
A FEW WEEKS AGO HERE.

00:03:38.821 --> 00:03:41.390
BUT, YEAH, NO.

00:03:39.622 --> 00:03:43.025
IT MAKES NO SENSE.

00:03:41.524 --> 00:03:44.660
I TOLD HIM IN THAT MEETING

00:03:43.159 --> 00:03:46.329
THAT, YOU KNOW, INDIVIDUALS

00:03:44.794 --> 00:03:47.964
HAVE TO BE HELD ACCOUNTABLE

00:03:46.462 --> 00:03:49.098
FOR THEIR INDIVIDUAL ACTIONS

00:03:48.097 --> 00:03:49.765
UNDER THE RULES WE HAVE AT

00:03:49.232 --> 00:03:51.534
THE SCHOOL.

00:03:49.899 --> 00:03:53.002
AND YOU KNOW, IF I HAD IT MY

00:03:51.667 --> 00:03:54.737
WAY, WE WOULD JUST ABIDE BY

00:03:53.136 --> 00:03:56.439
THE FIRST AMENDMENT AND WE

00:03:54.871 --> 00:03:56.739
WOULDN'T HAVE ALL THESE

00:03:56.572 --> 00:03:57.573
