00:03:56.939 --> 00:03:58.608
&gt;&gt; Tucker: I GET IT.

00:03:57.773 --> 00:04:01.110
&gt;&gt; IF WE ARE GOING TO HAVE

00:03:58.741 --> 00:04:02.278
THESE STRICT RULES AND

00:04:01.244 --> 00:04:03.412
