&gt;&gt; Tucker: RYAN, I REALLY

00:04:07.216 --> 00:04:09.852
APPRECIATE HOW BRAVE YOU ARE

00:04:08.084 --> 00:04:11.053
TO COME ON AND HOW CLEARLY

00:04:09.986 --> 00:04:12.622
